  "title": "Gingerbread Biscotti",
  "description": "This spicy Italian gingerbread biscotti cookie recipe is made with ground ginger, ground cinnamon, ground cloves, and ground nutmeg — perfect with coffee.",
  "authors": [
    "Cristina Gomez"
  ],
